    "turn_text": "Sort of first things first. We're all watching as things are unfolding in Texas. It seems every day there's another challenge Hopefully rescues are pretty much done at this point, but we've still got lots of destruction and devastation down there. One of the things you'll have to vote on when you go back, I'm sure, is a Hurricane Harvey relief bill. The destruction is massive. That bill is going to have to be massive. How much do you, it's going to be in the billions. We know that. How much do you think is going to be part of that bill to help those folks out in Texas?",
